msgstr "Enable"

#: front/components/sandbox/AgentRequestedDomainsSetting.tsx
msgid "Agent-requested domains"
msgstr "Agent-requested domains"

#: front/components/sandbox/AgentRequestedDomainsSetting.tsx
msgid "Applies to every Computer in this workspace, across all Pods. Allow agents to ask for additional domains, one approval per domain, during the conversation. When disabled, agents cannot request new domains and rely only on the allowed domains configured per scope below."
msgstr "Applies to every Computer in this workspace, across all Pods. Allow agents to ask for additional domains, one approval per domain, during the conversation. When disabled, agents cannot request new domains and rely only on the allowed domains configured per scope below."

